OL,3,APolicing minister making Commons
OL,4,Astatement after small boats protests in
OL,5,ADover and Portsmouth
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolicing minister Sarah Jones says
OL,8,Fpeople who "cross the line from
OL,9,Fpeaceful protest into illegality will
OL,10,Fface the full force of the law", in a
OL,11,Fspeech to the Commons
OL,13,FIt comes after police said earlier that
OL,14,Fa small number of officers were injured
OL,15,Fand some vehicles damaged during unrest
OL,16,Fin Portsmouth on Sunday
OL,18,FHundreds blocked roads in the city
OL,19,Fafter about 120 migrants were brought
OL,20,Fto shore
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
