OL,6,
OL,7,FA total of 625 migrants were brought to
OL,8,Fshore in Dover and Portsmouth
OL,9,Fyesterday, according to Home Office
OL,10,Ffigures - although overall, the number
OL,11,Fis down in 2026
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
