OL,3,AChancellor calls for 'confidence about
OL,4,ABritain' despite 'historic high'
OL,5,Aborrowing costs
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey has called for a
OL,8,Frestoration of "confidence about
OL,9,FBritain" despite acknowledging the
OL,10,Fchallenge of "historic high" borrowing
OL,11,Fcosts.
OL,13,FIn an interview with the BBC, Healey
OL,14,Fpromised that "doubling down" on "more
OL,15,Fgrowth generated in more places" will
OL,16,Fbe a central priority ahead of his
OL,17,Ffirst Budget on 28 October.
OL,19,FThe chancellor warned that "times are
OL,20,Ftough", referring to the announcement
OL,21,Fof 4,000 mostly UK-based jobs at Jaguar
OL,22,FLand Rover (JLR).
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
